messages:
olivia: starting staged rollout v3.4.0 -> canary 3% (us-east). change window 10:00-12:00 ET. release notes: https://redwood/release/v3.4.0 :rocket;

deploy-bot: ROLLOUT r-3658 initiated. target=canary:3% us-east. monitors: hallucination_rate, latency_p95, 5xx. log group /rollouts/r-3658. :robot_face:;

raj: smoke fine. running a quick semantic-quality sweep on top-50 prompts now.;

monitor-bot: alert: hallucination_rate on canary cohort increased from 0.4% -> 1.6% over 6m. absolute numbers small but above threshold. flagging for review.;

ops_lead: please pause ramp and pin until we understand. can someone reproduce with exact prompts?;

olivia: pinning rollout now. `deploy-bot pin r-3658 --reason "elevated-hallucination-rate"`;

deploy-bot: rollout pinned at 3%. state=paused. audit: olivia at 3658888895.

raj: pasted one example that repro:
"user: give me the summary of regulatory changes for product Y"
expected: cites policy doc ref-77
actual: invents a non-existent clause "section 7b" with confident phrasing.;

raj: logs snippet:
```
[10:11:22] infer-node-2 req=aa12 model=v3.4.0 output_conf=0.98 halluc_flag=true
[10:11:23] reranker: similarity_to_corpus=0.21 baseline=0.79
```

eval-bot: queued ev-1123 with prompt_set=top-50-regulatory. ETA ~9m.;

ops_lead: decision criteria: rollback if hallucination delta >= 1.0pp or if content-level false citations present in >2% of top-50. otherwise hold and triage patch.

raj: quick local run (N=50): 3 failures with false citations (~6%). that meets rollback criteria.;

olivia: I prefer rollback — risky to expose CS users. CS team on standby. cs-notify: please prep customer note.;

cs-notify: drafted: "We paused v3.4.0 canary due to a detected regression in factuality; routing reverted to v3.3.7 while we investigate. We'll share a follow-up with timeline.";

ops_lead: agreed. roll back and include audit tag. deploy-bot run rollback when ready.;

deploy-bot: executing: `deploy-bot rollback r-3658 --to v3.3.7 --notify "cs-team@redwood" --reason "factuality-regression"`;

deploy-bot: rollback complete. traffic reverted to v3.3.7. state=rolled_back. audit: rollback by olivia at 3658888942.;

monitor-bot: post-rollback check: hallucination_rate returned to baseline 0.5% within 2m. 5xx and latency stable.;

ops_lead: post-rollback actions: collect failing prompts (ev-1123), reproduce in staging with debug logits, run model-compare for citation generation, and vet patch candidate. schedule triage at 14:30 ET.

olivia: closing rollout for now. will reopen after patch + full eval passes. :white_check_mark:"
